WEBVTT

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.130
The angelic being who suddenly appeared before me

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.200
and saved my loveless heart...

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.620
Shio-chan.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:50.460
I have to protect my life with Shio-chan.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.380
Because I want to know more about love.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.760
That's why...

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:08.520
Turns out he had a wife and kids.
The jerk told me he was single.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.290
Seriously? No way.

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:13.120
Makes me want to kill him.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.190
Don't kill him.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.540
I was just joking.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.370
Who would kill someone just for love?

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.160
I see...

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.550
But I do wish my life could be like

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:26.760
an exciting love story.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.720
Like dating a teacher...

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:31.520
Like our homeroom teacher, Kitaumekawa?

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:32.710
That could be nice!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.900
-He's single and he's hot.
-You're right.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.380
Matsuzaka.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.880
Do you have a moment?

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.270
Kitaumekawa...

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:42.180
Speak of the devil...

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.530
Matsuzaka.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.660
I called your house yesterday to
talk academics,

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.600
but no one answered.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.520
Was something wrong?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.190
I think I was asleep already.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:58.110
No way. It was about seven o'clock.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.540
I was at work...

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.780
and my aunt goes out at night a lot too.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.430
I had heard your parents passed away,

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.960
and you're living with your aunt.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.210
-Excuse me.
-Matsuzaka...

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.500
If you're in trouble, just tell me.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.980
You're... How should I put it?

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:21.630
Less stable than the other girls.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.570
I'm worried about you.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.110
I'm an adult.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:28.140
I'm sure I can help you.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:35.160
I've already quit fooling around with boys.
I'm fine.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.980
I fell in love for real.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.650
But... Yeah...

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:43.320
There is one thing.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.490
I feel like

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:47.940
