00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.930
But I'm probably just imagining it.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.290
Thanks, teacher.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.990
A stalker?

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.230
Are you sure you're not imagining it?

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:13.330
You're cute so you have to be careful.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.270
Remember that customer
who wouldn't leave you alone?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:21.190
Satou-nyan, can you meow on my lap?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.660
Sir, this isn't that sort of business!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.800
What do you mean?

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.630
