00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.860
I can't bear it.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.680
Satou!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.530
I love you!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.950
Okay, you two.

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:54.270
