00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:17.180
But that girl's the person I love.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.850
It's so confounding.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:23.400
She fills the holes in my heart
like a puzzle,

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.520
