00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.590
You're right.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.370
It's not okay.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:38.920
Isn't that what's great about it?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.810
It's like walking on a tightrope.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.980
Like almost crossing that line.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:45.550
