00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.480
Thanks, Matsuzaka.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.500
I'm off. You rest here for a bit.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:20.300
Dad, Mom...

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.470
I'm sorry...

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:28.170
Shio Koube...

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:31.140
She's so cute.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.890
Little girls

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.970
are so cute.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.820
Then does that mean I shouldn't approach him?

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:45.390
-He seems okay with girls his age.
-Oh, really?

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.160
Yeah. But Mitsuboshi already has someone he likes.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.250
Hello?

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:56.210
Oh, sorry, Mother.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:59.570
I'm going to eat dinner with my friend.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.840
Okay.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.800
Yes.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.990
Bye.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:08.310
-Did I sound okay?
-Yeah.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:12.220
It's hard having a strict home.

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:15.770
But I have to meet their expectations.

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:18.300
At least on the surface.

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.590
You're a good girl, Shoko.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.820
Really?

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:25.240
Even though I'm off to fool around
with guys again today?

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.480
A good girl with lots of energy!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:37.320
What's your deal? Filthy little...

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:45.160
What I really want is my own prince, just like Satou.

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:47.800
Take that!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.850
No, thanks!

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:57.390
Damn. He's no good.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:59.010
He doesn't have any money.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.270
And he's so dirty.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.050
How useless.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.030
What exactly is this?

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.930
If she's still alive,
I'm sure she wishes she wasn't.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.320
You're right.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.240
-Poor guy...
-In sickness...

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.370
and in health...

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:17.330
What are you mumbling about?

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:19.280
What are you doing?

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.110
Who the hell are you?

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.840
Satou!

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:31.900
-Su-chan?
-Thanks for your hard work today too.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.680
You're really amazing these days.

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:37.430
You do the work of five people alone.

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:41.130
And you're even taking care of the new employee.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:43.550
It's nothing. He's my friend.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.970
By the way,

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.640
you live pretty close to me, don't you?

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:52.060
Can I come over sometime?

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.400
Don't push your way into my life.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:58.730
Sorry. My aunt wouldn't like it.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.780
Excuse me. Can you give me a hand?

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.260
Good...

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:11.080
It's not as bad as it looks.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:13.220
Thanks for helping.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.010
Can I go home now?

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.310
-Yeah. Go ahead.
-Sorry.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.810
Excuse me.

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:23.630
What happened to him?

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.980
He was getting beat up in the park.

00:21:25.980 --> 00:21:28.030
Should we call the police?

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.610
Don't tell the police.

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.820
They're the same.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:34.660
They won't do anything.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.650
Every last one of them...

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.370
Adults are all repulsive.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.480
I can't trust them.

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:42.870
Matsuzaka.

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:44.630
I'm going to call the manager.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:46.710
-Can you stay here?
-Okay.

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.210
I want to go home soon.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:59.220
I want to feel Shio-chan soon.

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:02.050
-And then...
-Our vows...

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:04.060
In sickness

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:06.180
and in health,

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.690
through happiness

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:09.140
and sadness,

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:10.780
for richer,

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:12.650
or poorer...

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:14.810
I promise to

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:16.940
-love you...
-Stop!

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.240
That's...

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:19.770
Wait!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:21.650
-That's...
-Shio...

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:23.280
Those words!

00:24:13.070 --> 00:24:15.210
Even if I cry,
even if I scream,

00:24:15.210 --> 00:24:16.780
even if I cover my ears,

00:24:16.780 --> 00:24:18.320
or close my eyes...

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:22.020
There's this vision that never disappears.

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:23.870
3rd Life:

00:24:23.870 --> 00:24:27.040
"A Long Monochromatic Night."
